<title>GERMANY: BOXING-MICHALCZEWSKI RETAINS WBO TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-MICHALCZEWSKI RETAINS WBO TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Dariusz Michalczewski stopped Chistophe Girard of France in the eighth round to retain his World Boxing Organisation (WBO) light-heavyweight title on Friday.</p>
</text>
